# --- Site build output ---
# Intermediates only. The mdBook spec is rendered into site/src/spec/ and (legacy)
# site/public/ — both gitignored. The published site is assembled into /docs at the
# repo root and IS committed: GitHub Pages ("Deploy from a branch" → main → /docs)
# serves committed files, so /docs is deliberately NOT ignored.
site/src/spec/
site/public/

